OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1786706288
OL,3,CTwo more charged with murder in
OL,4,Cconnection with fatal crash
OL,6,FTwo further men have been charged with
OL,7,Fmurder in connection with a fatal road
OL,8,Ftraffic collision in Swansea last
OL,9,Fmonth.
OL,11,FCeiran Evans, an 18-year-old from
OL,12,FGorseinon died following a crash
OL,13,Fbetween a car and an off-road bike.
OL,15,FThe incident on Pen Cae Crwn Road on 9
OL,16,FJuly also saw a 19-year-old man taken
OL,17,Fto hospital for his injuries.
