OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1786706288
OL,3,CTwo more charged with murder in
OL,4,Cconnection with fatal crash
OL,6,F33-year-old Elliot Truelove of West
OL,7,FCross and 18-year-old Liam Thomas of
OL,8,FMorriston were both charged with
OL,9,Fmurder and attempt murder on Tuesday,
OL,10,F11 August.
OL,12,F18-year-old Tyler Ford was previously
OL,13,Fcharged with the murder of Ceiran
OL,14,FEvans, as well as the attempted murder
OL,15,Fof the injured 19-year-old.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
