OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1786706288
OL,3,CTwo more charged with murder in
OL,4,Cconnection with fatal crash
OL,6,FDetective Chief Inspector Danielle
OL,7,FThorne, of the Major Crime
OL,8,FInvestigation Team, said: "This has
OL,9,Fbeen a complex investigation into an
OL,10,Fincident which has been incredibly
OL,11,Ftraumatic for both Ceiran Evans'
OL,12,Ffamily and the wider community of
OL,13,FGorseinon.
OL,15,F"These additional charges are another
OL,16,Fsignificant update as we seek to
OL,17,Funderstand the circumstances which led
OL,18,Fto Ceiran's death. We again thank the
OL,19,Flocal community for their assistance
OL,20,Fwith the investigation."
